            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>Votes, aggregate rating, rating text, rating colour and the rated flag are excluded as model features because the target is built from votes; a model that uses them is invalid (leaky). With votes and rating added, accuracy would be 98.8% (invalid).</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>Saved model: Gradient Boosting (chosen by 5-fold CV on the training set). Test set: accuracy 61.3%, macro-F1 0.611; majority baseline 33.6%.</run>
