            <format attr='background-color' value='#1f2329' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='0' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='3889' id='3' type-v2='text' w='54688' x='1250' y='556'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='15'>Restaurant Intelligence</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#1f2329' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='3056' id='4' type-v2='text' w='54688' x='1250' y='4444'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='9'>Zomato restaurants data (Kaggle, CC0) · Insights and recommendations</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#1f2329' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='3889' id='5' type-v2='text' w='97500' x='1250' y='8611'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>Key findings for all 9,551 restaurants (no filters). Associations in observational data, not causes. Every number is computed from the data by src/insights.py.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='20278' id='6' type-v2='text' w='31562' x='1250' y='13333'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>F1 · Market concentration  (83.2%)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>90.6% of the 9,551 restaurants are in India and 83.2% are in Delhi NCR alone.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='20278' id='7' type-v2='text' w='31562' x='33750' y='13333'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>F2 · Price range and popularity  (13.3% -&gt; 63.2%)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>The share of High-popularity restaurants rises from 13.3% in price range 1 to 63.2% in range 3 (55.0% in range 4); average rating rises from 3.24 to 3.89.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='20278' id='8' type-v2='text' w='31562' x='1250' y='34722'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>F3 · Table booking (India)  (63.0% vs 27.6%)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>In India (rated restaurants), 63.0% of restaurants with table booking are High-popularity, against 27.6% without; mean rating 3.55 vs 3.31.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='20278' id='9' type-v2='text' w='31562' x='33750' y='34722'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>F4 · Online delivery (India)  (44.6% vs 27.2%)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>In India (rated restaurants), delivery outlets are more often High-popularity (44.6% vs 27.2%), but their mean rating is almost the same (3.37 vs 3.34): delivery goes with more votes, not better ratings. Delivery exists only in India and the UAE.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='20278' id='10' type-v2='text' w='31562' x='1250' y='56111'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>F5 · Votes and rating  (rho 0.68)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>Votes and rating are strongly linked (Spearman rho = 0.68). The target is built from votes, so votes, rating and anything derived from them are excluded from the model&apos;s features.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='20278' id='11' type-v2='text' w='31562' x='33750' y='56111'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>F6 · Unrated restaurants  (2,148 (22.5%))</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>2,148 restaurants (22.5%) have no rating yet; only 4.5% of them offer online delivery, against 31.8% of rated ones.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='20278' id='12' type-v2='text' w='31562' x='1250' y='77500'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>F7 · Popularity model  (61.3%)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>The honest model (Gradient Boosting) reaches 61.3% accuracy against a 33.6% baseline. Location is its strongest signal: without location features accuracy falls to 51.9%.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='20278' id='13' type-v2='text' w='31562' x='33750' y='77500'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>F8 · Medium class  (44.8% vs 79.3%)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>Accuracy is 44.8% for restaurants within 5 percentile points of a class cut-off and 79.3% for those far from it. Telling High from Low alone (a separate, easier question) reaches 83.2%.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='13380' id='14' type-v2='text' w='32500' x='66250' y='13333'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>R1 · Choose the location first</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>Location and locality carry the most signal for popularity; compare candidate localities before deciding cuisine or price. Caveat: outside Delhi NCR the data lists mostly well-known restaurants, so part of the location effect reflects how Zomato sampled cities. (based on F1, F7)</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='13380' id='15' type-v2='text' w='32500' x='66250' y='27546'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>R2 · Offer table booking where the format allows it</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>It goes with a much higher share of High-popularity restaurants (association, not proof of cause). (based on F3)</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='13380' id='16' type-v2='text' w='32500' x='66250' y='41759'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>R3 · Use delivery for reach, not for rating</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>In India, delivery goes with a higher High-popularity share (44.6% vs 27.2%) but ratings barely differ (3.37 vs 3.34); service quality still drives the rating. (based on F4)</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='13380' id='17' type-v2='text' w='32500' x='66250' y='55972'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>R4 · Mind the price band</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>Mid and upper price ranges are more often High-popularity; budget outlets compete in a crowded, lower-voted segment. (based on F2)</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='13380' id='18' type-v2='text' w='32500' x='66250' y='70185'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>R5 · Help unrated restaurants get their first ratings</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>A fifth of listings have no rating; platform prompts or owner follow-up would make them comparable. (based on F6)</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone floating='true' h='13380' id='19' type-v2='text' w='32500' x='66250' y='84398'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='10'>R6 · Use the model as a screen, not a verdict</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#18181b' fontsize='9'>It separates likely High from likely Low well; Medium predictions near a cut-off are uncertain. (based on F7, F8)</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            <format attr='border-color' value='#e4e4e7' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{24326D7B-4C15-5F2E-AB30-DF9DFEAC03BC}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
